questions.stem:
Ivy has recorded the income she received each week for the past five weeks, where $n$ is the week number.

\begin{array}{c|ccccc} n\ (\text{week}) & 1 & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 \\ \hline \text{Income (\$)} & 200 & 100 & 300 & 300 & 400 \end{array}

Over the same five weeks, Ivy's expenses, which were originally $200 per week, increase by $20 each week. Write the equation of the least-squares regression line for Ivy's income, and determine the equation of Ivy's expenses.

